# PSE Signal Desk — repository ignore rules.
# Keep build output, package caches, local databases, secrets and editor/OS
# noise out of git. Syntax: https://git-scm.com/docs/gitignore
#
# Verify a rule with `git check-ignore -v <path>`; confirm that nothing wanted
# is ignored with `git ls-files -ci --exclude-standard` (it must print nothing).
# `!.env.example` style negations must stay *below* the rule they re-include.

# --- .NET build output ------------------------------------------------------
**/bin/
**/obj/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.slnx.docstates

# Test and coverage artefacts
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*.xml
coverage*.json
coverage*.info
*.lcov
*.opencover.xml
*.binlog

# Restored/packaged NuGet content. The per-project `.nuget/` folders appear when
# MSBuild resolves a *relative* global-packages folder (see the NUGET_PACKAGES
# gotcha in memory-bank/techContext.md); they are a local cache, never source.
**/.nuget/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
project.lock.json
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

# Local secret overrides. The Ollama key belongs in user-secrets or the
# environment (see memory-bank/techContext.md), never in a tracked file.
appsettings.*.local.json
*.pfx
*.snk
# npm auth tokens live in `.npmrc`; this repo needs no per-project registry.
.npmrc

# Local SDK/tool installs (`dotnet-install.sh --install-dir .dotnet`, `dotnet tool install --local`).
.dotnet/

# --- Local data (SQLite; created at API startup) ----------------------------
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
# Sidecar files follow the database's own spelling (`foo.sqlite-wal`, `foo.sqlite3-shm`).
*.sqlite-*
*.sqlite3-*
# Safety copies of the dev store, timestamped (`pse_signals.db.bak-20261125`)
# or not (`pse_signals.db.bak`) — both are local state.
*.db.bak*

# --- Node / Vite ------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
# Vite writes a temporary copy of a TypeScript config next to it; a killed
# process can leave one behind.
vite.config.*.timestamp-*
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# --- Local environment overrides (keep the Ollama key out of git) -----------
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example

# --- Editor / OS ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.localized
__MACOSX/
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100/
.Trashes/
.fseventsd/
.VolumeIcon.icns
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
*.iml
.fleet/
.history/
.vshistory/
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

# Stray `~/Library`-style folder the .NET developer tools create when HOME is
# resolved to the workspace root. Local machine state, not project content.
/Library/

# --- Misc run artefacts -----------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.pid
